你可能会在项目中看到一个 routetree.gen.ts 文件。
So if you go to the Tanstack Start documentation, they say right here, you may notice a route tree.gen.ts file in your project.

614
00:44:43,648 --> 00:44:51,408
当你通过 npm run dev 或 pnpm run dev 等命令运行 tanstack start 时，这个文件会自动生成。
This file is automatically generated when you run tanstack start via npm rundev or pnpm rundev and so on.

615
00:44:51,598 --> 00:45:02,928
这个文件包含了生成的路由树，以及一些 TypeScript 工具函数，
让 TanStack Start 的类型安全变得极快且完全可推断。
And this file contains the generated route tree and a handful of TypeScript
utilities that make Tanstack Start's type safety extremely fast and fully inferred.

616
00:45:03,088 --> 00:45:05,168
相信我，这是革命性的变化。
And trust me, this is a game changer.

