01:30:16,944 --> 01:30:23,904
就像布局路由一样，无路径布局路由用于用额外的组件和逻辑来包裹子路由。
So like layout routes, pathless layout routes are used to wrap child routes with additional components and logic.

1209
01:30:24,064 --> 01:30:36,864
不过，无路径布局路由不需要在 URL 中匹配路径，它们用于在不要求 URL 匹配路径的情况下，
用额外的组件和逻辑来包裹子路由。
However, pathless layout routes do not require a matching path in the URL and are used to wrap child routes with additional components
and logic without requiring a matching path in the URL.

1210
01:30:37,102 --> 01:30:39,744
那该怎么创建无路径布局呢？
