01:30:48,864 --> 01:31:05,344
前缀下划线之后的路径部分将作为路由ID，这是必须的，因为每个路由都必须是唯一的，
特别是在使用 TypeScript 时，这样可以避免类型错误并实现有效的自动补全。
And the part of the path after the prefix underscore is used as the route ID, and it's required because every route must be uniquely
identifiable, especially when using TypeScript, so as to avoid type errors and accomplish autocomplete effectively.

