直到我们最终发起请求来获取用户数据。
But essentially, we currently fetch the user data on the client side, which means this full page has to fully render until we then
finally make the request to get the user data.

2632
03:17:07,744 --> 03:17:12,612
如果这还是让你有点困惑，让我试着用这个图表来解释一下。
If this still confuses you a bit, let me try to explain it using this diagram.

2633
03:17:12,910 --> 03:17:16,144
所以我们有客户端、服务端，然后是数据库。
So we have the client, the server, and then the database.

2634
03:17:16,304 --> 03:17:18,464
服务端就是 TanStack Start。
The server is just 10 stack start.

2635
03:17:18,704 --> 03:17:23,904
所以 TanStack Start 有它自己的 Node.js 服务器，这就是我们使用 TanStack Start 的原因。
So tanstack start has its own Node.js server, that's why we use Tanstack Start.

2636
03:17:24,144 --> 03:17:28,464
然后数据库就是由 Neon 托管的我们的 Postgres 数据库。
And then the database is our Postgres database hosted by Neon.

2637
03:17:28,624 --> 03:17:35,824
所以每当用户想要访问某个路由，比如仪表盘路由时，客户端会向服务器发送请求。
So whenever a user wants to visit a certain route, let's say the dashboard route, the client makes a request to the server.

2638
03:17:35,984 --> 03:17:41,188
服务器接收到请求并看到，嘿，用户想要访问仪表盘路由。
The server gets the request and sees, hey, the user wants to visit the dashboard route.

2639
03:17:41,584 --> 03:17:48,036
所以我必须在服务端按需生成 HTML，然后将其发送到客户端。
So I have to generate the HTML on the server side on demand and then send it to the client.

2640
03:17:48,334 --> 03:17:50,304
所以在这种情况下，我们没有获取任何数据。
So in this case, we don't fetch any data.

2641
03:17:50,384 --> 03:17:51,652
我的意思是这是静态的。
I mean this is static.

2642
03:17:51,854 --> 03:17:59,396
所以没有向数据库发送请求，相反，服务器生成 HTML 然后将其发送到客户端。
So there is no request made to the database, but instead the server generates the HTML and then sends it to the client.

2643
03:17:59,664 --> 03:18:03,264
客户端获取 HTML 然后进行注水。
The client gets the HTML and then hydrates it.

2644
03:18:03,424 --> 03:18:07,264
