2645
03:18:07,344 --> 03:18:11,504
嗯，注水本质上是让你的应用程序变得可交互。
Well, hydration essentially makes your application interactive.

2646
03:18:11,598 --> 03:18:13,988
所以注水会加载 JavaScript。
So hydration loads the JavaScript.

2647
03:18:14,304 --> 03:18:15,824
