So at the top we get the document.

2651
03:18:26,464 --> 03:18:30,980
这是由服务端生成并发送到客户端的 HTML。
This is the HTML that got generated by the server and sent to the client.

2652
03:18:31,264 --> 03:18:36,944
如果我打开它并查看预览或响应，你就会看到这就是 HTML。
If I open it and open the preview or the response, then you will see that this is the HTML.

2653
03:18:37,134 --> 03:18:42,436
我们拿到了 div 元素以及我们在开始时创建的所有 HTML。
We get our div elements and all of the HTML that we created at the start.

2654
03:18:42,638 --> 03:18:51,396
但我们拿不到用户数据，因为用户数据只有在完整的 HTML 完全渲染并完成注水后才会加载。
But we don't get the user data, because the user data only gets loaded in once the full HTML fully rendered and with that hydrated.

2655
03:18:51,694 --> 03:18:56,384
所以一旦所有内容完成注水，我们就会向 API 端点发送请求。
So once everything hydrated, we make a request to our API endpoint.

2656
03:18:56,654 --> 03:19:05,024
所以在网络标签页中，如果我进行硬刷新并搜索 /api，我们就会向端点发送请求来获取会话。
So in the network tab, if I do a hard refresh and search for slash API we make the request to our endpoint to get the session.

2657
03:19:05,230 --> 03:19:08,864
然后这又需要大约一秒钟，我们才能拿到数据。
Then this takes again a second or so and we get the data.

2658
03:19:09,024 --> 03:19:17,824
正如你看到的，这虽然可行，但用户体验并不好，因为
用户现在看到了侧边栏，但获取用户数据需要一点时间。
And this works as you see, but this is not a great user experience because
the user now sees a sidebar, but it takes a bit to get the user data.

2659
03:19:18,336 --> 03:19:19,108
这不太理想。
It's not great.

2660
03:19:19,278 --> 03:19:23,492
所以最好是在服务端获取用户数据。
So it would be way better to fetch the user data on the server side.

2661
03:19:23,854 --> 03:19:30,736
如果我们回顾一下图表，用户想再次访问这个路由，所以客户端向服务器发送请求。
So if we look back at the diagram, the user wants to again visit this route, so the client makes the request to the server.

2662
03:19:30,926 --> 03:19:38,736
服务器收到请求后发现，嘿，我需要生成 HTML，但要生成 HTML，我需要用户数据。
The server gets the request and sees, hey, I need to generate the HTML, but to generate the HTML, I need the user data.

2663
03:19:38,990 --> 03:19:42,308
用户数据存储在外部数据库中。
The user data is stored in an external database.

2664
03:19:42,670 --> 03:19:52,736
于是服务器现在会向我们的数据库发送请求，在这种情况下是 Postgres，由 Neon 托管，
数据库随后获取数据并将其发回给服务器。
So the server will now make a request to our database, in this case, PostQuest, so hosted by Neon,
the database will then get the data and send it back to the server.

2665
03:19:52,910 --> 03:19:57,696
服务器现在拥有了完整生成 HTML 所需的所有数据。
The server now has all of the data needed to fully generate the HTML.

2666
03:19:57,902 --> 03:20:01,456
它一次性完成这一切，然后将其发回给客户端。
It does that at one time and then sends it back to the client.

2667
03:20:01,616 --> 03:20:04,256
这就是我们想要的用户体验。
And this is the experience that we want to have.

2668
03:20:04,416 --> 03:20:16,676
这意味着当用户发起请求时，我们不在客户端获取任何数据，而是所有内容一次性发送，
