3167
03:59:09,392 --> 03:59:13,392
如果我们保存并返回，你就能看到这个漂亮的按钮了。
And if we save this and go back, you will see this beautiful button.

3168
03:59:13,552 --> 03:59:16,912
我们现在就创建批量导入的表单。
Let's also right away create the form for the bulk import.

3169
03:59:17,312 --> 03:59:21,712
第一步是为特定表单初始化 useForm 钩子。
The first step is to initialize the use form hook for the specific form.

3170
03:59:21,872 --> 03:59:29,392
我打算复制这个常量表单，粘贴到下面，但不用叫 form，而是叫 bulkForm。
What I will do is copy this constant form, paste it down below, but instead of naming it form, this will be called bulk form.

3171
03:59:29,806 --> 03:59:31,392
我们需要更新模式。
We need to update the schema.

3172
03:59:31,472 --> 03:59:35,952
它不再是 import 模式，而是批量导入模式。
This won't be the import schema anymore, but rather the bulk import schema.

3173
03:59:36,112 --> 03:59:42,592
至于默认值，我们需要传递 search 属性，初始值将为空字符串。
