3174
03:59:42,832 --> 03:59:50,180
让我们滚动到底部，我打算复制这个完整的表单，然后把它粘贴到卡片内容里。
Let's scroll to the bottom and what I will do is copy this form, the complete form, and then paste it into the card content.

3175
03:59:50,414 --> 03:59:58,660
目前我们还没有卡片内容，所以在卡片头部下面，
我获取卡片内容组件，然后粘贴刚才复制的内容。
Currently we don't have a card content, so underneath the card header, I
will get the card content component and then I will paste what I just copied.

3176
03:59:58,832 --> 04:00:00,192
让我们分析一下代码。
Let's analyze the code.

3177
04:00:00,352 --> 04:00:09,792
表单看起来不错，但提交处理函数不对，因为我们不想写 form.handleSubmit，
