The form looks good, but the onSubmit handler is incorrect because we
don't want to say form.handle submit, but rather bulk form.handle submit.

3178
04:00:09,952 --> 04:00:12,192
接下来我们继续处理表单字段。
Then let's continue with the form field.

3179
04:00:12,366 --> 04:00:16,992
这不再应该是 表单字段，而应该是 bulkForm.字段。
This shouldn't be form.field anymore, but rather bulkform.field.

3180
04:00:17,198 --> 04:00:24,832
名称和其他内容都没问题，我们把这个 bulkForm.字段 复制粘贴到下面，这个是给搜索输入的。
The name and the rest is all fine, and let's copy paste this bulk form.field down below, and this one will be for the search input.

3181
04:00:25,072 --> 04:00:33,872
名称设为 search，字段标签不再写 URL，而是写 filter，我还会加上括号写 optional。
The name will be search, then the field label won't say URL anymore, but rather filter, and I will add parentheses and say optional.

3182
04:00:34,112 --> 04:00:43,312
我还要更新占位符，占位符我写 example，内容是 block, docs, tutorial。
What I will also do is update the placeholder, and for the placeholder I will say example and this will be block, docs, tutorial.

3183
04:00:43,472 --> 04:00:52,592
这样用户就能过滤特定内容，比如只过滤 block 文章，或者可能只过滤 doc 页面之类的。
With that, the user will be able to filter for specific content, so either
for only block articles or maybe only for doc pages and stuff like that.

3184
04:00:52,752 --> 04:01:00,352
按钮本身目前看起来还可以，但我把 import URL 改成 import URLs。
And then the button itself looks fine enough for now, but instead of saying import URL, I will say import URLs.

3185
04:01:00,526 --> 04:01:05,312
如果我们保存并返回，你就能看到这个漂亮的表单，而且它能正常工作。
And if I save this and go back, then you will see this beautiful form and it works.

3186
04:01:05,472 --> 04:01:12,592
我的意思是，如果我点击批量导入，我就看到这个卡片；如果我点击单个 URL，
我就看到那个卡片，然后就是这个表单。
I mean if I click on bulk import, I get this card, if I click on single URL, I get this card, and then with that this form.

3187
04:01:12,814 --> 04:01:17,872
顺便说一下，因为我们使用了 shadcn/ui，所以它也完全符合可访问性标准。
And by the way, since we use shared C and UI, this is also fully accessible.

3188
04:01:18,062 --> 04:01:21,284
所以我可以用键盘在两个标签页之间切换。
So I can use my keyboard to navigate between the two tabs.

3189
04:01:21,552 --> 04:01:22,512
是不是很酷？
Isn't that cool?

3190
04:01:22,752 --> 04:01:30,032
如果我点击导入 URL，我立刻就会收到错误，因为我们使用了 TanStack Form 进行表单验证。
And if I click on import URL, I instantly get an error because we have form validation using Tanstack form.

3191
04:01:30,352 --> 04:01:37,152
如果我添加一个 URL，比如这个，这是 React 官方博客文章的 URL。
And if I add a URL, let's say this one, so this is the URL of a block article by React itself.

3192
04:01:37,262 --> 04:01:45,792
如果我复制这个 URL 并粘贴到这里，然后点击导入 URL，我们不会收到任何事件或者任何反馈。
And if I copy the URL and paste it inside of here, and with that click
on import URL, we don't get any event or not event, any feedback.

3193
04:01:45,952 --> 04:01:48,032
没有任何吐司提示之类的。
There is no toast or anything like that.

3194
04:01:48,112 --> 04:01:56,832
但如果我打开检查器和控制台，你会看到我们有一个 console.log，并且我们打印了 URL 的值。
But if I open the inspector and with that the console, you will see that we have a console.log and we console.log the URL, the value.

3195
04:01:57,072 --> 04:01:58,948
但这就是我们想要做的全部吗？
But is that all that we want to do?

3196
04:01:59,152 --> 04:02:00,672
不，当然不是。
No, of course not.

3197
04:02:00,912 --> 04:02:03,364
我们想要做更高级的事情。
We want to do way more fancy things.

3198
04:02:03,728 --> 04:02:08,768
所以我创建了一个漂亮的小图表，以便更好地理解这一切。
So I created a nice little diagram to understand everything a bit better.

3199
04:02:09,102 --> 04:02:10,608
那么我们想要做什么呢？
So what do we want to do?

3200
04:02:10,768 --> 04:02:14,116
嗯，我们想要创建一个 ETL 流水线。
Well, we want to create a ETL pipeline.

3201
04:02:14,448 --> 04:02:20,772
本质上，我们想要提取内容，对其进行变换，然后利用 LLMs 进行加载。
Essentially, we want to extract content, transform it, and then load it with LLMs.

3202
04:02:21,088 --> 04:02:24,996
这听起来可能有点让人困惑，所以让我们来看看这个图表。
This might sound a bit confusing, so let's go through the diagram.

3203
04:02:25,358 --> 04:02:27,396
第一步是创建一个表单。
Step one is to create a form.

3204
04:02:27,598 --> 04:02:33,028
也就是说，用户通过表单给我们提供一个 URL，这就是我们已经实现的部分。
So a user gives us a URL via the form, and that's what we already implemented.

3205
04:02:33,328 --> 04:02:45,796
我们有一个表单，用户可以把任何博客文章、任何文档网站，
总之任何最终能加载出内容的 URL 粘贴进去。
We have a form, and a user can just paste any URL to a blog article, to some documentation site, in general,
any URL that then at the end of the day loads some content.

3206
04:02:46,062 --> 04:02:48,928
下一步是抓取博客文章。
The next step is to scrape the blog article.

3207
04:02:49,102 --> 04:02:51,248
这意味着我们想要获取内容。
What that means is we want to get the content.

3208
04:02:51,408 --> 04:02:55,728
所有这些，我们只想去那个网站并复制所有内容。
All of this, we want to just go to the website and copy everything.

3209
04:02:55,968 --> 04:02:57,252
真的是所有内容。
Literally everything.

3210
04:02:57,568 --> 04:03:00,260
第三步是变换内容。
The third step is to transform the content.

3211
04:03:00,494 --> 04:03:06,372
因为如果我只是现在直接复制它，那它就不是非常，该怎么说呢，结构化的。
Because if I would just copy it right now, then this would be not very, how should I say, structured.

3212
04:03:06,688 --> 04:03:10,596
我们想要结构化的内容，也就是 Markdown。
We want to have structured content, which means markdown.

3213
04:03:10,862 --> 04:03:17,604
所以我们想把它变换成 Markdown，然后把这个 Markdown 内容存入我们的数据库。
So we want to transform it to markdown and then store this markdown content in our database.

3214
04:03:17,870 --> 04:03:21,728
这就是所谓的 1、2、3、4 步骤之类的。
So this is the what 1, 2, 3, 4 step or something like that.

3215
04:03:21,888 --> 04:03:25,168
最后一步是总结内容。
And then the last step is to summarize the content.

3216
04:03:25,328 --> 04:03:28,048
也就是把它总结成一个更小的条目。
So summarize it into a smaller item.

3217
04:03:28,238 --> 04:03:29,728
这就是我们要创建的东西。
That's what we want to create.

3218
04:03:29,808 --> 04:03:32,900
再次强调，这被称为 ETL 流水线。
Again, this is called ETL pipeline.

3219
04:03:33,168 --> 04:03:35,488
目前我们已经实现了第一步。
And currently we implemented step one.

3220
04:03:35,808 --> 04:03:39,568
我们有了表单，用户可以粘贴任何随机的 URL。
We have the form and users can paste any random URL.

3221
04:03:39,728 --> 04:03:44,528
下一步是抓取文章块，或者更通俗地说，是抓取内容。
And the next step is to scrape the block article or in general the content.

3222
04:03:44,768 --> 04:03:47,488
这里我问大家一个问题。
And here's a question from me to you.

3223
04:03:47,728 --> 04:03:51,396
你该如何从外部网站抓取数据？
How can you scrape data from an external website?

3224
04:03:51,648 --> 04:03:54,052
因为我不拥有那个 React 网站。
Because I don't own the React website.

3225
04:03:54,288 --> 04:03:56,848
我不能打电话给某人说，嘿，你知道吗？
I can't call someone and say, hey, you know what?

3226
04:03:56,928 --> 04:04:00,528
我需要你们网站或者博客文章的 Markdown 文件。
I need the markdown for your website or for your blog article.

3227
04:04:00,768 --> 04:04:01,808
这样做行不通。
This does not work.

3228
04:04:01,968 --> 04:04:08,548
这是一个外部网站，我必须通过某种方式访问它，然后通过某种方式复制内容。
This is an external website that I have to access somehow and then somehow copy the content.

3229
04:04:08,848 --> 04:04:16,128
因为让用户粘贴 URL，然后由我手动去网站上复制所有内容，这根本不可行。
Because it isn't feasible for the user to paste the URL and then for me to go manually to a website, copy everything.

3230
04:04:16,288 --> 04:04:17,248
这行不通。
This does not work.

3231
04:04:17,454 --> 04:04:18,688
我们想要自动化它。
We want to automate it.

3232
04:04:18,848 --> 04:04:27,648
所以我们需要通过某种方式让我们的代码访问某种外部网站，复制内容，并将其变换为 Markdown。
So we need to somehow allow our code to visit some sort of external website, copy the content, transform it into markdown.

3233
04:04:27,808 --> 04:04:33,796
所以我们想要获取结构化数据，然后通过某种方式将
其存储在我们的数据库中，并进行所有那些高级操作。
So we want to get structured data and then also somehow store it in our database and do all of the fancy stuff.

3234
04:04:34,062 --> 04:04:38,116
那么，你现在该如何抓取这个你并不拥有的外部网站呢？
And how can you now scrape this external website that you don't own?

3235
04:04:38,574 --> 04:04:38,848
嗯。
Hmm.

3236
04:04:39,182 --> 04:04:42,404
所以你现在可能会说，好吧，这真是个有趣的问题。
So now you might say, okay Jen, interesting question.

3237
04:04:42,768 --> 04:04:52,208
我记得过去有一种解决方案，就是直接向网站发送请求，并获取所有的原始 HTML。
So I remember that in the past there was this one solution where you would
just make a request to the website and with that fetch all of the raw HTML.

3238
04:04:52,334 --> 04:04:58,208
然后使用像 Chirio 这样的第三方库，你就可以解析 DOM 了。
And then using a third-party library like for example Chirio, you could then also pass the DOM.

3239
04:04:58,448 --> 04:05:04,928
因为例如 Chirio 是一个用于解析和操作 HTML 以及 XML 的库。
Because for example, Chirio is a library for passing and manipulating HTML and XML.

3240
04:05:05,038 --> 04:05:08,288
这意味着你必须自己编写所有的选择器。
And this means you have to write all of the selectors yourself.

3241
04:05:08,368 --> 04:05:12,928
所以你发送请求，然后使用 Chirio 来获取你需要的数据。
So you make a request and then you use Chirio to access the data you need.

3242
04:05:13,134 --> 04:05:20,208
我想这有时可行，但我认为我们都能同意，这听起来已经有点让人困惑了。
And this I guess works sometimes, but I think we both can agree that this already sounds a bit confusing.

3243
04:05:20,448 --> 04:05:23,488
因为这种方法有很多问题。
Because there are a lot of problems with such an approach.

3244
04:05:23,648 --> 04:05:33,488
首先，如果网站使用了大量的 JavaScript，或者更通俗地说，如果这个网站例如是在客户端渲染，
也就是 CSR，那么这就行不通了。
First of all, if the site uses a lot of JavaScript, or in general, if this site, for
example, would be rendered on the client side, CSR, then this would not work anymore.

3245
04:05:33,648 --> 04:05:39,648
因为如果我打开检查器并查看网络，例如我们在这里获取了这个文档。
Because if I open the inspector and with that the network, we for example, right here get this document.

3246
04:05:39,888 --> 04:05:41,968
这个文档包含了所有的内容。
This document has all of the content.

3247
04:05:42,128 --> 04:05:44,996
那是因为这个网站是在服务端渲染的。
That's because this site is rendered on the server side.

3248
04:05:45,198 --> 04:05:49,408
但如果它是用客户端渲染的，那它就真的是空的。
But if this would be rendered on the client side, then this would be literally empty.

3249
04:05:49,614 --> 04:05:59,248
如果我向这个 URL 发送请求，我拿到的也会是空的 HTML，这意味着这种方法行不通，这不太好。
And if I would make a request to this URL, then I would also get empty
HTML, which means this approach would not work, which is not good.

3250
04:05:59,568 --> 04:06:13,988
另一点是，用这种方法，你会被布局变动搞得焦头烂额，处理无限滚动会很麻烦，
懒加载也没什么用，Cookie 横幅也会跟你作对，或者你要跟它们作对。
Another thing is that with such an approach, you would fight layout changes, infinite scroll would be annoying to handle,
lazy loading is another thing that would not really work, cookie banners would also fight with you, or you would fight with them.

3251
04:06:14,254 --> 04:06:20,848
所以总的来说，你会得到非常凌乱的 HTML，而且很难处理并让它变得可用。
So in general, you get very messy HTML and it's very hard to pass it and make it usable.

3252
04:06:21,008 --> 04:06:29,796
如果网站变动了，导致元素也变了，那你的整个抓取工作流就会断掉，因为你得更新你的代码。
And if a website changes and with that the elements change, then also
your whole scraping workflow breaks because you need to update your code.

3253
04:06:29,968 --> 04:06:40,928
总的来说，这种方法非常脆弱，维护成本很高，而且它无法处理很多网站，
因为实际上很多网站都是在客户端渲染的。
In general, such an approach is very fragile, it's high maintenance, and it won't work with a lot of websites since actually many
websites are loaded or rendered on the client side.

3254
04:06:41,326 --> 04:06:46,080
所以现在你可能会说，好，Jan，我们放弃 Chirio，把它扔进垃圾桶吧。
So now you might say, okay Jan, let's scratch Chirio, let's throw it into the bin.

3255
04:06:46,510 --> 04:06:49,360
还有另一个选择叫做 Puppeteer。
There is another alternative called Puppeteer.

3256
04:06:49,520 --> 04:06:51,200
Puppeteer 到底是什么？
What exactly is Puppeteer?

3257
04:06:51,280 --> 04:07:02,640
嗯，Puppeteer 是一个 JavaScript 库，它提供了一个高层级的 API，
通过 DevTools 协议或 WebDriver BIDI 来控制 Chrome 或 Firefox。
Well, Puppeteer is a JavaScript library which provides a high level API
to control Chrome or Firefox over the DevTools protocol or WebDriver BIDI.

3258
04:07:02,862 --> 04:07:07,520
Puppeteer 在无头模式下运行，所以预设情况下没有可见的 UI。
Puppeteer runs in the headless, so no visible UI by default.

3259
04:07:07,726 --> 04:07:12,960
所以我们可以使用真实的浏览器，而这个真实浏览器就可以与网站进行交互。
So we can use a real browser, and this real browser can then interact with websites.

3260
04:07:13,120 --> 04:07:16,720
例如，针对这个特定的博客文章页面。
Or for example, with this specific blog article page.

3261
