And what even is middleware?

4021
05:01:29,456 --> 05:01:40,096
嗯，中间件允许你自定义服务端路由（比如 GET、POST
等）以及通过 创建服务端函数 创建的服务端函数的行为。
Well, middleware allows you to customize the behavior of both server routes like get, post, etc.,
and server functions created with create server function.

4022
05:01:40,336 --> 05:01:49,056
中间件是可组合的，甚至可以依赖其他中间件来创建一个按顺序执行的操作链。
Middleware is composable and can even depend on other middleware to create a chain of operations that are executed in order.

4023
05:01:49,216 --> 05:01:52,176
