4274
05:19:29,872 --> 05:19:33,156
所以这个中间件会在每一个请求上运行。
So this middleware will run on literally every request.

4275
05:19:33,454 --> 05:19:41,152
每当你发起请求到达服务器之前，这个中间件都会拦截请求并检查用户是否已身份验证。
Whenever you make a request before hitting the server, this middleware
will intercept the request and check if the user is authenticated.

4276
05:19:41,326 --> 05:19:46,788
如果用户未通过身份验证，这个中间件就会说：嘿，用户，停，停，停。
If the user is not authenticated, this middleware will say, Hey user, stop, stop, stop.

