05:19:46,992 --> 05:19:52,352
我会把你重定向，然后中间件会将用户重定向到 slash login 或者抛出一个错误。
I will redirect you, and then the middleware will redirect the user to slash login or throw an error.

4278
05:19:52,432 --> 05:19:54,192
这取决于你想让它做什么。
It depends on what you want it to do.

4279
05:19:54,352 --> 05:19:57,872
