07:25:35,118 --> 07:25:42,276
所以我们可以显示加载状态，就像他们这里说的，部分内容，这是带有加载状态的布局。
So what we can do is show a loading state, as they say here partial content, this is the layout, with loading state.

5922
07:25:42,384 --> 07:25:43,504
这是加载状态。
This is the loading state.

5923
07:25:43,886 --> 07:25:47,056
然后这里他们说，挂起的内容正在流式传输进来。
And then here they say suspended content streaming in.

5924
07:25:47,216 --> 07:25:49,316
这个内容目前正在加载中。
This content is currently being loaded.

5925
07:25:49,536 --> 07:25:52,804
在加载期间，我们将显示加载状态。
While it's being loaded, we will show a loading state.

5926
07:25:52,942 --> 07:26:00,996
一旦数据加载完成，比如 5 秒后，我们将把加载状态替换为真实内容。
And once the data has finished loading, for example, after 5 seconds, we will swap out the loading state for the real content.

5927
07:26:01,216 --> 07:26:05,764
这就是所谓的流式传输，或者换句话说，是延迟数据加载。
This is what you call streaming, or in other words, suspended data loading.

5928
07:26:05,936 --> 07:26:16,720
有趣的是，在浏览了一会儿 TanStack Router 文档后，我还发现了一个章节在讨论这种延迟数据
加载，但他们没叫它延迟数据加载或流式传输之类的名字。
And the interesting thing is after now going through the Tan Stack Router documentation a bit,
I also found a section from them also where they talk about this suspended data loading,

5929
07:26:16,720 --> 07:26:21,616
有趣的是，在浏览了一会儿 TanStack Router 文档后，我还发现了一个章节在讨论这种延迟数据
加载，但他们没叫它延迟数据加载或流式传输之类的名字。
but they don't call it suspended data loading or streaming or something like that.

5930
07:26:21,856 --> 07:26:24,256
他们称之为延迟数据加载。
They call it deferred data loading.

5931
07:26:24,416 --> 07:26:27,364
本质上是同样的东西，所以我觉得没关系吧？
It's essentially the same thing, so I guess who cares?

5932
07:26:27,662 --> 07:26:29,216
让我们快速看看他们是怎么说的。
Let's quickly see what they say.

5933
07:26:29,550 --> 07:26:39,620
TanStack Router 的设计，以及随之而来的 TanStack Start 的设计，都是为了并行运行加载器，
并在渲染下一个路由之前等待所有加载器解析完成。
Tanstack Router is designed, and with that also Tanstack Start, is designed to run
loaders in parallel and wait for all of them to resolve before rendering the next route.

5934
07:26:39,856 --> 07:26:49,284
这在大多数情况下非常好，但偶尔你也可能希望在
其他数据在后台加载时，先让用户看到一些内容。
This is great most of the time, but occasionally you may want to show the
user something sooner while the rest of the data loads in the background.

5935
07:26:49,550 --> 07:27:02,244
延迟数据加载是一种模式，它允许路由器在较慢的非关键路由数据在后台解析时，
先渲染下一个位置的关键数据标记。
Deferred data loading is a pattern that allows the router to render the next location's
critical data markup while slower non-critical route data is resolved in the background.

5936
07:27:02,496 --> 07:27:07,056
这个过程通过流式传输在客户端和服务器上同时运行。
This process works both on the client and server via streaming.

5937
07:27:07,216 --> 07:27:15,456
好，他们在这里也提到了流式传输，这是提高应用程序感知性能的一种极佳方式。
Okay, they also mention streaming inside of here, and it's a great way to improve the perceived performance of your application.

5938
07:27:15,776 --> 07:27:16,896
听起来很棒。
That sounds great.

5939
