6794
08:31:48,752 --> 08:31:57,232
但 API 端点是设计成全局可用的，而服务端端点是设计成本地使用的，但同时也是公开的。
But an API endpoint is designed to be globally available, and a server
endpoint is designed to be local but at the same time still public.

