7236
09:04:00,878 --> 09:04:06,704
如果你想更多了解这种失效机制，我建议你去查阅文档。
And if you want to learn more about this invalidation, then I would recommend you to go through the documentation.

7237
09:04:06,894 --> 09:04:12,144
因为这里提到 TanStack Router 内置了短期缓存。
Because inside of here they say Tanstack Router comes with short-term caching built in.

7238
09:04:12,334 --> 09:04:26,144
所以即使我们在路由匹配卸载后没有存储任何数据，但如果对路由器中存储的数据进行了任何变
更，当前路由匹配的数据很有可能会过期。
So even though we are not storing any data after a route match is unmounted, there is a high probability that if any mutations are
made related to the data stored in the router, the current router matches data could become stale.

7239
09:04:26,304 --> 09:04:35,424
当针对加载器数据的变更发生时，我们可以使用 路
由失效 来强制路由器重新加载所有当前的路由匹配。
When mutations related to a loader data are made, we can use router.invalidate
to force the router to reload all of the current route matches.

7240
09:04:35,664 --> 09:04:47,344
失效所有当前的匹配是在后台发生的，因此在准备好新数据
之前，现有数据将继续提供，就像你正在导航到新路由一样。
Invalidating all of the current matches happens in the background, so existing data will continue to be served until new data is
ready, just as if you were navigating to a new route.

7241
09:04:47,566 --> 09:04:56,224
所以当你使用这个 invalidate 方法时，它会使整个路由器失效，
这意味着它会重新获取所有数据，而且所有这些操作都是在后台完成的。
So when you use this invalidate method, it invalidates the full router, which
means it refetches all of the data, and all of that is done in the background.

7242
09:04:56,384 --> 09:05:01,584
一旦数据被重新获取，它就会重新加载所有内容并渲染新数据。
Once the data has been refetched, it then reloads everything and renders the new data.

7243
09:05:01,744 --> 09:05:02,864
这难道不强大吗？
Isn't that powerful?

7244
09:05:03,104 --> 09:05:13,156
这与你在 Next.js 中看到的情况非常相似，因为在 Next.js 中你也有一个需要失效，
或者换句话说，需要重新验证的缓存。
This is very similar to what you have in Next.js, because in Nextjs you also
have a cache that you need to invalidate, or in other words, revalidate.

7245
09:05:13,424 --> 09:05:18,464
但在这里，他们不叫重新验证，而是叫失效，这也是没问题的。
But here instead of revalidating it, they call it invalidation, which is also fine.

7246
09:05:18,624 --> 09:05:27,652
本质上，你失效所有的查询，然后在后台重新获取数据，这样你就能得到新数据并渲染出来。
Essentially, you invalidate all of the queries and then refetch the data in the background,
and with that you will get new data and also render it.

